4M18 12h4\">\n                        </path>\n                    </svg>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"focus-ring icon-button flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white text-lg font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-15-2\" data-name=\"zoom in button\">\n                    +\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"focus-ring icon-button flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white text-lg font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-15-3\" data-name=\"zoom out button\">\n                    −\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n        <aside class=\"inspector flex flex-col border-l border-slate-200 bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"member inspector\">\n            <div class=\"mobile-grab mx-auto mt-2 hidden h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"mobile handle\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex h-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 px-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"inspector header\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"inspector title group\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"header label\">\n                        Anggota terpilih\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"inspector heading\">\n                        Detail anggota\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <button aria-label=\"Tutup detail\" class=\"focus-ring icon-button flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"close inspector button\">\n                    <svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"close icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                        <path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\">\n                        </path>\n                    </svg>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"inspector-scroll scrollbar flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"inspector content scroll area\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"member summary section\">\n                    <span class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-indigo-100 text-lg font-bold text-indigo-700 ring-4 ring-indigo-50\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"avatar initials\">\n                        A\n                    </span>\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"profile info group\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"display name\">\n                            Ali / iis\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-xs text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"full name\">\n                            Ali Iskandar\n                        </p>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 inline-flex rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"age and status badge\">\n                            45 tahun · aktif\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-5 border-y border-slate-100 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"family relationship section\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"section header\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"header text\">\n                            Ringkasan keluarga\n                        </h3>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"relation count\">\n                            5 hubungan\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-3 space-y-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"relationships list\">\n                        <button class=\"focus-ring flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"parent relationship row\">\n                            <span class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"relation role\">\n                                Bapak\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex-1 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"related person name\">\n                                Wa Eyo\n                            </span>\n                            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"chevron icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\">\n                                </path>\n                            </svg>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"focus-ring flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"mother relationship row\">\n                            <span class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"relation role\">\n                                Ibu\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex-1 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"related person name\">\n                                Ceu Iyah\n                            </span>\n                            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"chevron icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\">\n                                </path>\n                            </svg>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"focus-ring flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"partner relationship row\">\n                            <span class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"relation role\">\n                                Pasangan\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex-1 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"related person name\">\n                                Ika\n                            </span>\n                            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"chevron icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\">\n                                </path>\n                            </svg>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"focus-ring flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"child relationship row\">\n                            <span class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"relation role\">\n                                Anak\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex-1 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"related children names\">\n                                Nina, Reni\n                            </span>\n                            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"chevron icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\">\n                                </path>\n                            </svg>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3\" data-name=\"personal info section\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-1\" data-name=\"section header\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"header text\">\n                            Informasi pribadi\n                        </h3>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"mode indicator\">\n                            Mode admin\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2\" data-name=\"input field group\">\n                        <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"nickname label field\">\n                            <span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"input label\">\n                                Nama panggilan\n                            </span>\n                            <input class=\"h-10 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 text-xs text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-100\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"nickname input\" readonly=\"\" value=\"Ali / iis\"/>\n                        </label>\n                        <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"full name field\">\n                            <span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"input label\">\n                                Nama lengkap\n                            </span>\n                            <input class=\"h-10 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 text-xs text-slate-800 outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-100\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"full name input\" readonly=\"\" value=\"Ali Iskandar\"/>\n                        </label>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-3\" data-name=\"gender selection\">\n                            <span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"input label\">\n                                Jenis kelamin\n                            </span>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"gender button group\">\n                                <button class=\"h-10 rounded-lg border-2 border-blue-500 bg-blue-50 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"male button\">\n                                    Laki-laki\n                                </button>\n                                <button class=\"h-10 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white text-xs font-medium text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"female button\">\n                                    Perempuan\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-4\" data-name=\"year and residence fields\">\n                            <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"birth year field\">\n                                <span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"input label\">\n                                    Tahun lahir\n                                </span>\n                                <input class=\"h-10 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 text-xs text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"birth year input\" readonly=\"\" value=\"1981\"/>\n                            </label>\n                            <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"domicile field\">\n                                <span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"input label\">\n                                    Domisili terakhir\n                                </span>\n                                <input class=\"h-10 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 text-xs text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"domicile input\" readonly=\"\" value=\"Citayam\"/>\n                            </label>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4\" data-name=\"add relationship section\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-1\" data-name=\"section heading\">\n                        Tambah hubungan\n                    </h3>\n                    <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-2\" data-name=\"action button group\">\n                        <button class=\"focus-ring flex-1 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-2 text-[10px] font-semibold text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"add partner button\">\n                            + Pasangan\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"focus-ring flex-1 rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-2 text-[10px] font-semibold text-indigo-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"add child button\">\n                            + Anak\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"shrink-0 border-t border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"inspector footer\">\n                <div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-emerald-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"status message group\">\n                    <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"success dot\">\n                    </span>\n                    Semua perubahan sudah tersimpan\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"action buttons group\">\n                    <button class=\"focus-ring flex-1 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-sm shadow-indigo-600/20\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"save changes button\">\n                        Simpan perubahan\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"focus-ring rounded-lg border border-rose-200 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"delete button\">\n                        Hapus\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
