                        Saudara kandung\n                            </span>\n                            <button class=\"relation-name\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-4-2\">\n                                Adi · Mbu / Mba Nur\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relation-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-5\">\n                            <span class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-5-1\">\n                                Anak\n                            </span>\n                            <button class=\"relation-name\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-5-2\">\n                                Hafidz · Hanin\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <section class=\"mt-5 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1\">\n                        Data pribadi\n                    </h3>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-1\">\n                            <label class=\"field-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-1-1\" for=\"nickname\">\n                                Nama panggilan\n                            </label>\n                            <input class=\"field-input\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-1-2\" id=\"nickname\" value=\"Ali / iis\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-2\">\n                            <label class=\"field-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-2-1\" for=\"fullname\">\n                                Nama lengkap\n                            </label>\n                            <input class=\"field-input\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-2-2\" id=\"fullname\" value=\"Ali Iskandar\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-3\">\n                            <label class=\"field-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-3-1\">\n                                Jenis kelamin\n                            </label>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-3-2\">\n                                <button class=\"h-10 rounded-lg border-2 border-blue-500 bg-blue-50 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-3-2-1\">\n                                    Laki-laki\n                                </button>\n                                <button class=\"h-10 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-3-2-2\">\n                                    Perempuan\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-4\">\n                            <label class=\"field-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-4-1\" for=\"domicile\">\n                                Domisili terakhir\n                            </label>\n                            <input class=\"field-input\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-4-2\" id=\"domicile\" value=\"Citayam\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-5\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-5-1\">\n                                <label class=\"field-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-5-1-1\" for=\"birth\">\n                                    Tahun lahir\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"field-input\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-5-1-2\" id=\"birth\" value=\"1981\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-5-2\">\n                                <label class=\"field-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-5-2-1\" for=\"death\">\n                                    Tahun wafat\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"field-input\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-5-2-2\" disabled=\"\" id=\"death\" placeholder=\"—\"/>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <label class=\"flex min-h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-6\">\n                            <input class=\"h-4 w-4 accent-indigo-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-6-1\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n                            Sudah meninggal dunia\n                        </label>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <section class=\"mt-5 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1\">\n                        Catatan dan media\n                    </h3>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-2\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-2-1\">\n                            <label class=\"field-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-2-1-1\" for=\"bio\">\n                                Biografi ringkas / link sosial\n                            </label>\n                            <textarea class=\"w-full resize-none rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-3 text-xs text-slate-800 outline-none\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-2-1-2\" id=\"bio\" placeholder=\"Pekerjaan, hobi, atau tautan...\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"flex min-h-10 w-full items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-2-2\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-2-2-1\">\n                                Tambah atau ganti foto\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-indigo-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-2-2-2\">\n                                Pilih file\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"mt-5 status-note flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-6\">\n                    <svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-6-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                        <path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\">\n                        </path>\n                    </svg>\n                    Perubahan disimpan\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sticky-footer\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1\">\n                    <button class=\"flex-1 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-3 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-1\">\n                        Simpan perubahan\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2\">\n                        Hapus\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-center text-[10px] text-slate-400\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"menyimpan perubahan pesan\" data-reason=\"text status refreshed dynamically by script\">\n                    Saat tersambung: “Menyimpan perubahan…” · Jika gagal, nilai tetap tersimpan untuk dicoba lagi.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
